  "name": "Small Dread Guristas Synchronizer",
  "description": "Built from Caldari synchronizers hacked to accommodate Gallente software, this rig improves drones, ECM modules, and shield resistances. However, the incompatibility of the Gallente firmware with Caldari technology results in greatly reduced drone control ranges. It also integrates the pathways between Dread Guristas technology. This unlocks even greater performance the more Dread Guristas modules are installed.\n\nPenalty: Using more than one type of this module or similar modules that affect the same attribute on the ship will be penalized.\n\nThe CPU drawbacks of fitting this rig may be reduced by training the <a href=showinfo:96100>Synchronization Rigging</a> skill.",
